DOM-VPWEM

This project implements and adapts the VPWEM architecture described by Yuheng
Lei, Zhixuan Liang, Hongyuan Zhang, and Ping Luo in "VPWEM: Non-Markovian
Visuomotor Policy with Working and Episodic Memory".

The implementation was validated against the Apache-2.0 reference source at:
https://github.com/HarryLui98/code_vpwem
commit 5e372e847793ced1c37d39d4efa7b2b710eb826c

The data and environment adapter targets MIKASA-Robo-VLA, which is distributed
separately under its own license:
https://github.com/CognitiveAISystems/MIKASA-Robo

No MIKASA dataset trajectories, simulator assets, or oracle checkpoints are
distributed in this repository.

The optional simulator-asset installer retrieves the unmodified "Low Poly
Light Bulb" model by AleixoAlonso from the MIKASA-Robo v1.0.0 release commit
16634db18bef08128ed79346469c86fc12169aed. The model's original source is:
https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/low-poly-light-bulb-a7d27c2224d94c86a04083de8f9df7db
The model is licensed separately under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
